So that’s It.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.080
Pun intended.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.600
Of course there may be a few things that I
missed, so let me know what you might have

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.600
noticed in the comments.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.279
I’ll probably do a follow up episode once
the movie comes out on Blu-Ray and I can really

00:20:53.279 --> 00:20:56.429
dig deep for any details that went under the
radar in this video.

